 by brothers Walt and Roy Oliver Disney as Disney Brothers Cartoon Studio, Disney operated under the names Walt Disney Studio and Walt Disney Productions before adopting its current name in 1986. In 1928, Disney established itself as a leader in the animation industry with the short film Steamboat Willie. The film used synchronized sound to become the first post-produced sound cartoon, and popularized Mickey Mouse, who became Disney's mascot and corporate icon.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Walt_Disney_Company"},"ru":{"t":"The Walt Disney Company","x":"The Walt Disney Company — транснациональная медиакорпорация. Штаб-квартира располагается в комплексе Walt Disney Studios в городе Бербанк.","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Walt_Disney_Company"}},"wiki_at":"2026-10-15T14:12:00.444892+00:00"}